  <reason>Subject and account: The subject of this report is Tariq Naveed, holder of account PK**MUCB****6560, opened on 30 December 2020. The customer's declared occupation is medical sales officer (salaried), with a declared income of PKR 220,000 per month.

Activity summary: During the period 2 June 2026 to 25 June 2026, the account recorded 14 credits totalling PKR 19,311,000 as well as 4 debits totalling PKR 14,618,000. The credits included 13 cash deposits totalling PKR 19,091,000, made over the counter at 4 branches (Clifton Branch, DHA Phase 6 Branch, Gulshan-e-Iqbal Branch, Saddar Branch). The activity was detected on 25 June 2026, when Tazama typology STR-PK-01 scored 320 against an alert threshold of 300.

Grounds for suspicion: 9 of 13 cash deposits (69%) were between PKR 1,600,000 and PKR 1,999,999, totalling PKR 16,420,000, just below the cash transaction reporting threshold of PKR 2,000,000. The cash was deposited across 4 branches (Clifton Branch, DHA Phase 6 Branch, Gulshan-e-Iqbal Branch, Saddar Branch) rather than at a single branch. Credits in the activity window were 87.8 times the declared monthly income, against a declared income of PKR 220,000 per month. Taken together, these indicators are consistent with suspected structuring; the reporting entity has not established the underlying offence.

Flow of funds: Of the outgoing funds, PKR 7,825,000 was sent to Crescent Imports (PK**CRES****1592, Synthetic Bank C) in 2 transactions. Of the outgoing funds, PKR 6,793,000 was sent to Sheraz Traders (PK**SHER****1518, Synthetic Bank A) in 2 transactions. Funds did not remain in the account: debits equal to 76% of credits, with a median of 28.4 hours between the latest credit and each debit.

Other considerations: Screening of the subject returned no match on sanctions, PEP or adverse-media screening on 28 June 2026.

Action taken by the reporting entity: Action taken: a note by L2 analyst (28 June 2026): "Account placed under enhanced monitoring pending the reporting decision. No contact made with the customer about this review."</reason>
